                                                                    <!--
                                                                        Age rating mark, pinned to this card's right edge so it costs no
                                                                        vertical space. Dropped below the Details header rather than
                                                                        level with it: alongside the heading it crowded both the title
                                                                        and the card edge. It now starts around the first data row,
                                                                        with enough inset to read as placed rather than shoved.
                                                                    
                                                                        Drawn rather than shipped as art: nothing to source, it scales, and
                                                                        no trademarked image file is redistributed in the package. PEGI is a
                                                                        solid colour block with a white number over a white strip; ESRB is a
                                                                        white box with a black band. They are recognisable approximations.
                                                                    
                                                                        The rating name cannot be split into system and value without a
                                                                        converter, so each known rating sets its own text and colour, and
                                                                        picks which of the two marks to show. Anything unrecognised falls
                                                                        through to the raw name on a neutral chip rather than rendering blank.
                                                                    -->
                                                                    <ItemsControl ItemsSource="{Binding Game.AgeRatings}"
                                                                                  HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,46,22,0" Panel.ZIndex="10">
